{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nearly Impossible Odds is an incremental game where you increase the chances of unlikely events happening at the same time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlikely events include finding a four-leaf clover or being struck by lightning. The initial odds of winning a level can be worse than 1 in a trillion. By clicking and also letting a meter fill automatically, you will gain experience and money. You can use money to buy upgrades which increase your odds of winning a level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 20 levels of increasingly slim odds of victory. Can you beat them all?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3900210?t=1759610552","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3900210?t=1759610552","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900210/d4619e8a5c5cc60bc31de0ac31aa409caf775e2d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759610552","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900210/d4619e8a5c5cc60bc31de0ac31aa409caf775e2d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759610552","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nearly Impossible Odds is an incremental game where you increase the chances of unlikely events happening at the same time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlikely events include finding a four-leaf clover or being struck by lightning. The initial odds of winning a level can be worse than 1 in a trillion. By clicking and also letting a meter fill automatically, you will gain experience and money. You can